## Components

- **Buttons:** outline style by default (1px border, ink text). Primary
  CTA only: moss fill, white text, `--radius-md`, no shadow.
- **Cards (`.card` class):** white background, 1px `stone/10` border,
  `--shadow-card`, `--radius-lg`, padding `24px`. Hover: border → moss,
  `--shadow-card-hover`, scale 1.02.
- **Nav:** ink background, bone/white text, moss underline on
  active/hover link state. Nav stays ink even on white pages — a fully
  white nav on a white page loses brand presence, so this is intentional
  and shouldn't be "corrected" to match the page surface.
- **Badges/tags:** clay background at 12% opacity, clay text, used only
  for sale/new/limited labels — never as a primary color anywhere else.

